4
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:06,493
Don:

5
00:00:06,493 --> 00:00:07,341
Yeah – it’s here .

6
00:00:07,341 --> 00:00:07,391
.

7
00:00:07,391 --> 00:00:07,441
.

8
